r sure what's a joke and  what's foreshadowing especially when the  straw hats are involved meanwhile  frankie is bragging about how well the  sunny held up after the drop saying they  only busted a small yard on the mast i'd  assume that kid in law had even worse  damage but we don't find that out  finally we get the moment we've all been  waiting for the reveal of every straw  hats bounty and i'm conflicted as i'll  get into there is definitely some hype  here with these being called the updated  bounties for the leaders of the 5 600  man grand fleet emperor strawhat luffy  and his nine commanders so awesome to  see all our straw hats being called  commanders at this point now that we are  a yonko crew chopper as the commander  pet has the ongoing joke that he has a  low bounty and the joke continues as  chopper the cotton candy lover as he's  called only went from 100 berries to 1  000 berries even chopper is mad it  barely went up but from here the  bounties get pretty high from lowest to  highest nami has a bounty of 366 million  which she freaks out about since she  knows that even she would go after  someone with such a high bounty brooks  is 383 million cyborg frankie's is 394  million but he's upset since the sunny  is on the poster not him although in my  view he should be happy his skilled  creation made it on at least and is  being appreciated in a way sniper god  usopp is now 500 million and he is  depressed because like nami he knows it  makes him a target and he begged please  no more don't go higher i think he's  actually scheduled for an epic fight  this upcoming arc and then his bounty  will really skyrocket whether he likes  it or not although i think he'll be more  cool with the new one because he'll  embody more of that brave warrior of the  sea ideal that he's aiming for robbins  is awesome at 930  million and yeah it's not all about  power with robin we know that but let's  not get it twisted she was super strong  against black maria and i feel like she  should get more respect strength wise  than she usually does i also love how  she doesn't even react to her bounty as  she's more concerned with just making  chopper feel better about his own low  bounty such great waifu material right  here lastly we have the big three aside  from luffy namely sanji jinbei and zorro  now this was totally predictable so i  will take zero credit for calling it but  zorro has surpassed sanji once again and  sanji is predictably upset sunshi's  actually below jimbei as well as below  our pirate hunter zoro right now still  it's hyped that his bounty is over 1  billion at 1 billion and 32 million  jimbei is 1.1 billion while zoro is  barely ahead at 1 billion 100 million 1  100. still zorro more than deserves it  and my issue with these last bounties is  that like luffy's they really should be  higher after defeating king and queen  zoro and sanji's bounties deserve to be  higher than theirs and yet they are not  which makes no sense to me but i guess  we just gotta accept that they lowballed  our boys this time around and will have  to wait for another round of bounties to  be satisfied finally again we get  luffy's bounty of 3 billion as he's  proclaimed the fleet captain emperor  straw hat luffy even as he's  pathetically beaten up and trapped in a  cage and whining about being hungry  meanwhile sanji is fighting because zoro  called him number four and zoro  hilariously tells him to mind his tone  around the crew's second as a zoro stan  i must say it's good to see him back in  second where he belongs now we jump to  the very good buggy part of the chapter  we find out that buggy isn't the  undisputed leader of the organization  yet as some people may have thought in  fact he's crying and saying he'll do  anything even lick crocodiles boots  clean which it must be said is not  pirating energy like with luffy in this  chapter his title of emperor is  contrasted with a very unemperor-like  situation crocodile then gives us some  much-appreciated explanations he  explains that cross guild was supposed  to be under him and mihawk which makes a  lot of sense he asks so why is buggy  considered the boss buggy says he can't  do anything but apologize while mihawk  says buggy is probably the only person  in history to become an emperor after  crying for mercy he adds that having  buggy die here wouldn't even begin to  make up for this crocodile says it's  beyond insulting and when buggy begs to  be spared mihawk tells him not to make  unreasonable requests which is a pretty  hilarious line i must say galdino who is  not so loyal to buggy tries to get in  crocodiles good graces by saying it's so  nostalgic to be serving him again and  although buggy is upset by this we can't  be surprised since galdino's always been  looking out for his own best interest  and we definitely saw this during the  impel down prison break buggy's top  followers also consider joining  crocodile since buggy is clearly a goner  too saying it's a cold harsh world out  there we then get a much appreciated  flashback as to how mihawk and crocodile  teamed up as we guessed the marines kept  swarming mihawk's island and yes mihawk  could deal with them but it was a  nuisance and he thought he'd have to  relocate and in the flashback crocodile  explains that is why it would be good  for them to team up the navy wouldn't  take an organization headed by them too  lightly so in reality this organization  was supposed to be headed by the  partnership of crocodile and mihawk  rather than by buggy which makes a lot  of sense especially when we get into  these guys as bounties we also get a  hype detail that they use to refer to  mihawk as the marine hunter compared to  zoro the pirate hunter which is a cool  parallel right there as well the two  find common ground and precisely the  fact that they have trouble finding  common ground with others they are the  same in that they don't trust anyone and  that's enough to get mihawk considering  the deal buggy for his part remembers  how he was gonna make a run for it when  the marines came for him until the  warships were attacked by crocodile this  led buggy's followers to assume that the  rumors are true crocodile is working  under buggy and thus risking his own  life to help buggy we get another  hilarious misunderstanding that inspires  loyalty and buggy's followers meanwhile  buggy knows crocodile must be here  because buggy owes him a lot of cash  even though he's broke he thinks to  himself that this is even worse than the  marines which is pretty hilarious  despite calling crocodile croco-chan  buggy is not having much luck at first  crocodile wants his money since he's  forming his own company buggy offers to  join and help crocodile's company he'll  serve him as a former warlord he'll work  twice as hard to pay his debt and he's  pretty correct when he says it's always  good to be flashy and get the word out  with a bang he points out that he has  connections that can help with  advertising printers couriers and so on  he says they can be worked to the bone  for free and so that is how the poster  that emphasized buggy in the boss  position got made and spread around  crocodile holds the poster up calling  buggy mr president ironically he's not  happy and in buggy's defense it wasn't  deliberate his men just loved him so  much they made him look like the leader  and the world believed it we even see  how he was shocked when he saw the final  product but it was too late since the  flyers were already sent out we even see  how the navy interpreted it they call  buggy the mastermind of the mass escape  from impel down a member of the pirate  king's crew which led to a close bond  with emperor shanks and they got  confirmed reports that crocodile came to  his aid when he attacked those marine  warships they also know that crocodile  and mihawk have made contact so it makes  sense after everything including the  poster that they think buggy is more  dangerous than he actually is it's even  pointed out that their new marine  hunting movement has already gotten  financial backing from a number of shady  organizations and again i gotta say the  marine hunting aspect is one of my  favorites in the story so far i  absolutely love that twist the marines  say that with the rebellions they're  already dealing with cross guild is  undoubtedly a massive threat so they  accordingly give these three high  bounties crocodile the actual mastermind  gets the lowest bounty out of the three  at 1.965 billion berries for his logia  ability and cunning guile which is still  way ahead of zorro so when it comes to  the top three in this organization  bounty wise this yonko crew is stacked  in reality crocodiles would probably be  even higher if he wasn't overshadowed by  buggy then we get the crazy moments  we've been waiting for for like 1 000  chapters we get a bounty for mihawk it's  also stated that he has even greater  sword skills than emperor shanks which  is implied in the name greatest  swordsman but still crazy to hear it  spelled out like this again it doesn't  say he's stronger but the statement  still suggests he'd win in a clean sword  fight against ayanko which is  unbelievably hyped and it's reflected in  his insane bounty as a non-yonko his  bounty is a crazy  3.59 billion berries that's almost as  high as shanks and when you consider  they think he's buggy's underling and  not a yonko leader it's not hard to  picture that mihawk could potentially  even have a higher bounty than shanks if  he was at the head of a yonko crew it's  speculation obviously but it's still so  insane to have someone like mihawk  around who has a higher bounty currently  than three of the four yonko and he's  not a yonko himself this chapter has  definitely gone a long way in adding  even more respect to mihawk's name which  is good because i think most don't give  him the respect he deserves then because  of all the reasons we covered and the  fact that they think buggy got mihawk  and crocodile to yield to his authority  buggy got a bounty of  3.189 billion higher than luffy's but  interestingly enough not higher than  mihawks this is like if zoro's bounty  was higher than luffy's man this chapter  is such a flex for mihawk i gotta say  and i'm loving it and although it didn't  show buggy in the best light we can't  deny buggy's superpower of being lucky  and being able to weasel himself out of  practically every situation i do love to  hear though that the world government  considers buggy an extremely dangerous  individual even as bounties have now  clearly ceased to be an accurate gauge  of a character's actual power not saying  they were especially accurate before but  it's clearer than ever that they are not  now especially after luffy and zoro got  so lowballed now i love mihawk here he's  the one that eventually decides that  it's not that bad having buggy as a  figurehead he has no interest in the  title of emperor he just longs for peace  and what mihawk wants crocodile seems to  go with mihawk decides to let buggy have  the target on his back and adds that  they can dispose of him if the need  arises crocodile says it's true and then  we see buggy acting as leader and saying  they formed cross guild to prepare for  the new age he then introduces the new  executives crocodile and mihawk buggy is  crying because he's so unsure of what  will happen to him while his men assume  he's moved to tears because he's so  happy or something and they say they are  moved to tears as well we then catch up  with the revolutionaries as if this  chapter wasn't already hype enough most  people like me believe in sabo however  dragon says he's glad sabo is okay but  if he truly murdered king cobra then he  won't forgive him no matter what his  reasons this is definitely building the  mystery and a possible rift between  dragon and sabo who's become arguably  more famous as of late in the world of  one piece it's nice to see kuma freed in  a panel but it is sad hearing him just  talk like a slave saying i'm yours to  command master even koala tears up while  witnessing the scene we then jump to the  marines who are picking up a call that  is in fact sabo the flame emperor  calling the revolutionaries the manga  asks us will we find out the truth and  we're told we have a break next week but  wow what an amazing chapter to go on  break with this was amazing 10 out of 10  in my view even if i am a bit salty  about luffy and zoro's bounties not  being higher still the mihawk  awesomeness was so good this chapter it  arguably made up for it let me know your  thoughts on the chapter and how you  would rate it channel the parking within  and smash that like button if you  enjoyed this review and want to keep  them coming be a smashing pirate king  rather than passing orochi and youtube  will reward you with wano fireworks make  this the video you subscribe if you  haven't already and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates and while  you wait for the next one-piece video  and chapter to drop feel free to check  out my giant and growing one-piece  playlist that includes videos in all the  yonko admirals warlords mythical zone  users and much more link to that is in  the description and on screen right now  and until next time see you space  cowboys

